# This is a placeholder for a sample Excel file
# The actual file would contain columns like:
# - Security Ticket (with Jira ticket IDs)
# - summary (ticket summary)
# - priority (ticket priority)
# - current_status (will be populated by the script)
# - next_status (will be populated by the script)
# - transition_status (will be populated by the script)

# Sample data structure:
# | Security Ticket | summary | priority | current_status | next_status | transition_status |
# |----------------|---------|----------|----------------|-------------|-------------------|
# | SEC-123 | SQL Injection vulnerability found in login form | High | New | Analysing | Success |
# | SEC-124 | Cross-site scripting alert from scanner | Medium | Analysing | Refining | Success |
# | SEC-125 | CSRF token missing in form submission | Critical | Refining | Refined Backlog | Success |
# | SEC-126 | Password policy allows weak passwords | Low | Refined Backlog | Inprogress | Success |
# | SEC-127 | Missing security headers in web application | High | Inprogress | End of workflow | No transition needed | 